<title>USA: Comarco Inc Q3 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Comarco Inc Q3 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>YORBA LINDA, Calif. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>COMARCO INC.</p>
<p>		 (Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			 Three Months Ended	Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			  Oct. 31     Oct. 29    Oct. 31    Oct. 29</p>
<p> STATEMENT OF INCOME    1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenue		 $18,370    $18,486    $50,876    $53,060</p>
<p> Direct costs	   11,943     11,839     31,638     33,555</p>
<p> Indirect costs	  4,906	5,230     14,541     15,572</p>
<p>Total operating costs</p>
<p>			    16,849     17,069     46,179     49,127</p>
<p> Operating income	1,521	1,417	4,697	3,933</p>
<p> Net interest income     126	  114	  426	  346</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>			     1,647	1,531	5,123	4,279</p>
<p> Income taxes		558	  511	1,844	1,583</p>
<p>   Tax rate		  34%	  33%	  36%	  37%</p>
<p> Net income		1,089	1,020	3,279	2,696</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>   Primary		  0.20	 0.20	 0.61	 0.53</p>
<p>   Fully diluted	  0.20	 0.20	 0.61	 0.53</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>of common stock</p>
<p>     Primary	 5,376,000  5,120,000  5,380,000  5,067,000</p>
<p>Fully diluted</p>
<p>			 5,376,000  5,126,000  5,380,000  5,088,000</p>
